          "text": "That sounds like a very stressful experience, especially being left without your luggage at the border. I’m glad the bus photo and plate number helped the border police track the company down and recover your belongings. Thank you for sharing the details — experiences like this are important for other travelers to be aware of. 🙏🇱🇦",
